Third-party attributions

This file records, per docs/PROVENANCE.md, every third-party source (code,
algorithm reference implementation, or substantial design reference) that
influenced tessera. It is updated in the same commit as any code that draws on
a new source — see AUTOROUTER_PLAN.md §11.2 and §11.4/rule 8.

No third-party code has been ported into tessera yet. This section is a
placeholder populated as of ADR-0001 (docs/DECISIONS.md); entries are added
alongside the commits that introduce each dependency or ported/derived module.
